Artinya kita harus terus berlatih di malam hari.

294
00:11:12,759 --> 00:11:14,240
Karena kita sudah berada di babak semi-final,

295
00:11:14,279 --> 00:11:15,759
Kita harus memenangkan hadiah, kan?

296
00:11:16,480 --> 00:11:17,279
Aku merasa saat ini,

297
00:11:17,279 --> 00:11:19,960
Beban yang saya pikul cukup berat.

298
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,279
Jangan khawatir.

299
00:11:21,320 --> 00:11:23,080
Dengan kamu di dalamnya, kamu pasti tidak akan menang.

300
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:24,320
Anda bisa tenang.

301
00:11:25,879 --> 00:11:26,639
Baiklah.

302
00:11:26,639 --> 00:11:28,120
Jangan ganggu dia lagi.

303
00:11:28,220 --> 00:11:28,759
Beri ruang.

304
00:11:29,919 --> 00:11:30,720
Ayo pergi. Aku tidak mau makan.

305
00:11:30,720 --> 00:11:31,259
Aku sudah selesai makan.

306
00:11:31,679 --> 00:11:32,399
Selamat makan.

307
00:11:35,759 --> 00:11:36,559
Penggemar Laos

308
00:11:37,600 --> 00:11:39,279
Apakah ini karena kejadian beberapa hari yang lalu?

309
00:11:40,159 --> 00:11:41,240
